  "name": "Frozen Bodies grants a stack when a Necromancer minion kills an experience-yielding enemy (#10035)",
  "contract": [
    "Frozen Bodies 707562 grants a stack of 712434 when the Necromancer kills an enemy that yields experience or",
    "honor. Pet and player kills already grant it, but a Necromancer Ghoul is a guardian, so Unit::Kill fires",
    "neither OnPlayerCreatureKill nor OnPlayerCreatureKilledByPet when it lands the killing blow. A level-30",
    "Necromancer commands the Ghoul to kill a level-30 Rabbit, a critter that yields no experience and must grant",
    "nothing, then a level-30 enemy, which must grant one stack. The Necromancer never attacks, so no Frost",
    "critical strike can grant it."
  ],
